  "Traffic, mobility, environment, safety, and campus agents assess a shared scenario against distinct objectives.": "Mobili, taama, sigida, lakana ni inivɛrisite baarakɛlaw bɛ kɛwale kelen lajɛ u ka ɲɛsigiw kɔnɔ.",
  "Compare simulated interventions": "Kɛcogo kɔrɔbɔlenw suma ɲɔgɔn ma",
  "A seeded network simulation evaluates each response against the baseline over five intervals.": "Sira kɔrɔbɔli bɛ jaabi kelen-kelen suma fɔlɔ ma waati duuru la.",
  "Explain the recommendation": "Ladilikan ɲɛfɔ",
  "Inspect the evidence, weighted scores, agent disagreements, and verification in the audit trace.": "Daliluw, sumaliw, baarakɛlaw ka sɔsɔli ni kɔrɔsili lajɛ.",
  "Control model execution": "Misali baara kɔrɔsi",
  "Keep model execution local or connect approved cloud providers. Workspace policy controls where advisory requests run.": "Misaliw kɛ yɔrɔnin walima ka cloud dilatɛ sɔnnenw jɛngɛ. Baarayɔrɔ sariya bɛ baara yɔrɔ sugandi.",
  "Repeat experiments": "Kɔrɔbɔliw kɛ tuguni",
  "Adjust assumptions, compare agent or provider configurations, and export the run with its seed and input fingerprint.": "Miiriliw yɛlɛma, baarakɛla ni dilatɛ labɛnniw suma, ka jaabiw bɔ ni u ka kisɛ ye.",
  "City operations": "Dugu baaraw",
  "Compare diversions, transit priority, and advisories when a junction becomes unavailable.": "Sira jɛgɛ datugulen na, sira yɛlɛma, taama fɔlɔya ni ladilikanw suma.",
  "Campus planning": "Inivɛrisite labɛnni",
  "Evaluate the effects of arrivals, closures, and large events on campus access.": "Seliw, datuguliw ni kɛwale belebelew kɔlɔlɔ lajɛ inivɛrisite donni kan.",
  "Research and public administration": "Ɲinini ni foroba ɲɛmɔgɔya",
  "Test policy weights, document assumptions, and retain evidence for independent review.": "Sariya girinyaw kɔrɔbɔ, miiriliw sɛbɛn ka daliluw mara.",
  "This feature is disabled for the organization.": "Nin fɛn dabilala jɛkulu la.",
  "The configured provider did not complete the model task.": "Dilatɛ labɛnnen ma misali baara ban.",
  "The feed could not be refreshed. Check its endpoint, credentials, and format.": "Kunnafoni kura ma sɔrɔ. URL, kilisi ni cogoya lajɛ.",
  "Local baseline": "Yɔrɔnin misali fɔlɔ",
  "City snapshot": "Dugu cogoya"
}
